          "html_url": "https://github.com/KageBinary"
        },
        "body": "Thank you for the issue. You framed the underlying principle exactly right: `--kind` is a *filter*, not a *tiebreaker*, and silently analysing the wrong symbol is worse than asking which one was meant.\n\nTracked by **#380**, which is approved and carries `Fixes #379`, so this will close automatically when it lands.\n",
